1. EXO
===============================================================================

Applies to:  ui-kit/assets/fonts/exo-latin.woff2
             ui-kit/assets/fonts/exo-latin-ext.woff2
             ui-kit/assets/fonts/exo-vietnamese.woff2
             and the @font-face declarations in ui-kit/css/ep-fonts.css

Exo is the interface typeface: every screen renders in it, at weights 400 and
700. The three files here are the latin, latin-ext and vietnamese subsets of
the variable font, which is why three files serve the whole weight range.

They are self-hosted rather than fetched from a font service. That is what lets
the kit make no network requests at all, so it works offline, from file://, and
inside a network that cannot reach an external host.

The font is redistributed unmodified apart from subsetting. The licence below
is the complete text that accompanies it, reproduced as the licence requires.

