2. IONICONS
===============================================================================

Applies to:  14 glyphs in ui-kit/js/ep-icons.js — home, bell, chart, rocket,
             check-circle, globe, person, docs, arrow-forward, calendar,
             settings, build, person-circle, doc-text

ep-icons.js holds 42 glyphs. Fourteen of them are Ionicons, carried over as path
data so the sidebar and topbar render the real marks rather than lookalikes.
The other twenty-eight are line glyphs drawn for Epic Pulse.

